1590:<p></p><p><span>Welcome to </span></p>    <p><strong><span><span><span>RAMESHWARI&nbsp;DEVI GIRLS&nbsp;COLLEGE, BHARATPUR</span></span></span></strong></p>    <p><span><span><span>(A State Govt. Girls PG College)</span></span></span></p>    <p><span><strong>Rameshwari Devi Government Girls &nbsp;College</strong>&nbsp;is located in the semi-urban area of&nbsp;</span><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bharatpur,_Rajasthan" target="_blank"><span>Bharatpur</span></a><span>&nbsp;city. The College is affiliated to the Maharaja Surajmal Brij University, Bharatpur. Its academic calendar is in consonance with the University calendar. Recognized by the UGC under 2 (f) and 12 (B) in March 1985, . The College offers diverse programs through 20 departments belonging to three faculties viz, Arts, Science and Commerce. This college was designated as&nbsp;CPE ( College With Potential for Excellence) College in 2011 &amp; is a RUSA beneficiary.</span></p>    <p><span>Recently it has been identified as DLQAC (Divisional Level Quality Assurance Cell) Convenor to monitor the quality assurance cell of all colleges of this division</span></p>    <p><strong><span>VISION, MISSION &amp; GOALS OF COLLEGE</span></strong></p>    <table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="table table-hover table-striped table-bordered table-responsive">  	<tbody>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p><span><strong><u>Vision</u></strong></span></p>    			<p><strong><em>Arise!</em></strong></p>    			<p><strong><em>Awake!</em></strong></p>    			<p><strong><em>And stop not t</em></strong><strong><em>ill the goal is achieved.&nbsp;</em></strong><strong><em>-Swami Vivekananda</em></strong></p>    			<ul>  				<li>To cater to quality education leading to self-reliance.</li>  				<li>To build responsible, sensitive, creative, and thoughtful citizens.</li>  				<li>To empower girls to fulfill their academic and professional passions</li>  			</ul>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p>.<span><strong><u>Mission</u></strong></span></p>    			<ul>  				<li>Foster academic carrier success through critical thinking, creativity, and cultural awareness.</li>  				<li>Creating innovative links among Education, Humanities, Arts &amp; Culture, Music, and Science.</li>  				<li>Strengthening support for dynamic faculty dedicated to Nation Building.</li>  				<li>Strive for Educational, Cultural, Economic, Environmental and Social advancement of “Brij area”.&nbsp;</li>  			</ul>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p>&nbsp; <span><strong><u>Goals</u></strong></span></p>    			<ul>  				<li>To prepare professionals for quality Education, Teaching &amp; Research, Services, and Leadership.</li>  				<li>To improve life and standards of individuals in changing global society.</li>  				<li>Promoting all-around excellence in education.</li>  				<li>Enhance commitment of faculties, staff &amp; students for effective and efficient management of the college.</li>  				<li>Creating better infrastructure for strengthening and contributing to global competence.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</li>  			</ul>    			<p>&nbsp;</p>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p>&nbsp;</p>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td><span><strong>Strength; Weaknesses; Opportunities &amp; Challenges</strong></span></td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p><strong><u>Strength</u></strong></p>    			<ul>  				<li>Well qualified faculty.</li>  				<li>Despite many challenges, the girls are doing fairly well in Games &amp; Sports. (Archery &amp; Softball at International level)</li>  				<li>Diversity of students from all sections of society.</li>  				<li>Enriching cultural pursuits.</li>  				<li>State-level awards in extension activities to the NSS Officers.</li>  			</ul>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p><strong><u>Weaknesses</u></strong></p>    			<ul>  				<li>Teacher-student ratio, 50% of posts are falling vacant.</li>  				<li>The building area is not sufficient.</li>  				<li>Scarcity of playgrounds.</li>  				<li>Unavailability of girl’s hostel.</li>  			</ul>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p><strong><u>Opportunities</u></strong></p>    			<ul>  				<li>Many programs pertaining to skill development are run.</li>  				<li>Safe and conducive atmosphere for all-around development.</li>  			</ul>  			</td>  		</tr>  		<tr>  			<td>  			<p><strong><u>Challenges</u></strong></p>    			<ul>  				<li>In spite of the meager teacher-student ratio, the examination results are fairly high due to committed faculties.</li>  				<li>The location of the college building falls within the preview limits of the Archaeological Survey of India, restricting infrastructural development.</li>  				<li>A fairly low number of chances for campus plac</li>  			</ul>  			</td>  		</tr>  	</tbody>  </table>    <p><a href="/Website/RameshwariDeviGirlsCollegeBharatpur/Images/f53b6b57-428c-4b13-97b7-46174c47e9a0.pdf"><span><strong>CODE OF CONDUCT OF COLLEGE</strong></span></a></p><p></p>
